    "assumptions": {
      "model": "New geometry-audited 33-sphere reconstruction; asset selection fixed before benchmark outcomes, not original author assets.",
      "random_inputs": "Original task list, seeds, obstacle dimensions and pose distribution are unpublished. Fixed environment indices0..9 are declared constructed cases, not blind held-out tasks. Obstacle RNG SeedSequence[250410783,seed] retains fixed previous scenes. Independent start/target streams [250410783,5,seed,1 or2] select first collision-free joint-uniform point in each TCP box; target is its FK (not uniform Cartesian/SO3). Each side has a strict200000 sample cap. Goal joints are solved ONLINE per roadmap; no reselection after planner/optimizer failure.",
      "velocity_acceleration": "Unit per-joint bounds as released example/hardware section; simulation limits and Bezier degree unpublished.",
      "nto": "Original DRM nodes initialize order-2 distance splines; order-4 time splines repeat first/last control once for standstill. No arclength resampling. Use exactly Nc collision constraints to match the formal PDF; positions k/(Nc+1), k=1,...,Nc are declared construction choices. Draft TeX uses Nc-1 internal bindings and is preserved separately in v4.",
      "solvers": "LSCS Clarabel substitutes for unlicensed MOSEK. LGCS exact Gurobi MISOCP; restricted-license failures retained. Native wheel and solver versions postdate paper.",
      "budget": "60s solver limit and 240s case watchdog are reconstruction limits, not values supplied by paper.",
      "validation": "Dense independent Drake checks with bounded step; no continuous collision certificate. Known-invalid DRM seeds are not inflated; NTO still receives them as warm starts. Native DRM success and independently valid DRM success are reported separately.",
      "endpoint_margin": "1e-5 m IK margin is a declared numeric implementation choice to obtain collision-free float32-representable endpoints without changing target poses; the paper does not specify its numeric margin.",
      "eizo_max_iterations": "30 from author arXiv TeX commented parameter blocks. Formal published Tables III/IV take precedence for all overlapping settings.",
      "drm": "Offline native node, adjacency, pose and voxel collision maps for BOTH environments. Online goal IK is initialized by collision-free pose-map nearest nodes, per Section V-B. Native lazy step 0.1 retained. Unpublished native planner defaults are recorded.",
      "forest_inputs": "Same fixed predeclared environment seeds and endpoints as v3; static point radius1e-6. Random endpoint coordinates and original seed list not released."
    },
